### 1c. Gene panel (constructed from the Belykh abstract)
27 AGI loci, TAIR-authoritative, hard-coded in `code/smoke_check.py` and `code/enrichment_test.py`:
- 5 AOX-family (AOX1a/1b/1c/1d, AOX2)
- 14 DDR (ATM, ATR, SOG1, RAD51, RAD54, BRCA1, PARP1, PARP2, KU70, KU80, LIG4, OGG1, APE1L, WEE1)
- 8 antioxidant (MSD1/MnSOD, FSD1/FeSOD, CSD1, CSD2, CAT1, CAT2, APX1, GR1)

